#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.desktop.in.in:2
msgid "E-Mail"
msgstr "E-Mail"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.desktop.in.in:3
msgid "Read your email"
msgstr "Deine E-Mails lesen"

#. Translators: search terms, separated by semicolons, ending with a semicolon.
#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.desktop.in.in:10
msgid "mail;email;imap;inbox;"
msgstr "mail;email;e-mail;imap;posteingang;"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Simple, modern email"
msgstr "Einfach und modern mailen"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"E-Mail is a simple email app for GNOME and KDE. It connects to your accounts "
"with IMAP and SMTP and does nothing else: no calendar, no chat, no contact "
"management."
msgstr ""
"E-Mail ist eine einfache E-Mail-App für GNOME und KDE. Sie verbindet sich "
"per IMAP und SMTP mit deinen Konten und macht sonst nichts: kein Kalender, "
"kein Chat, keine Kontaktverwaltung."

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid "Several accounts, strictly kept apart"
msgstr "Mehrere Konten, streng getrennt"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:13
#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:46 crates/app/src/about.rs:36
msgid "Conversations with replies right below the message"
msgstr "Unterhaltungen mit Antworten direkt unter der Nachricht"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:14
#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:47 crates/app/src/about.rs:37
msgid "Writing with formatting, pictures and a signature per account"
msgstr "Schreiben mit Formatierung, Bildern und einer Signatur pro Konto"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:15
#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:49 crates/app/src/about.rs:39
msgid "Search with filters and keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Suche mit Filtern und Tastenkürzel"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:16
#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:50 crates/app/src/about.rs:40
msgid "Notifications through the system, also with the window closed"
msgstr "Benachrichtigungen über das System, auch bei geschlossenem Fenster"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "External images stay blocked until you allow them"
msgstr "Externe Bilder bleiben blockiert, bis du sie freigibst"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Passwords are kept in the system keyring"
msgstr "Passwörter liegen im Schlüsselbund des Systems"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:43 crates/app/src/about.rs:43
msgid "The first release."
msgstr "Die erste Version."

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:45 crates/app/src/about.rs:35
msgid "Several IMAP accounts, strictly kept apart"
msgstr "Mehrere IMAP-Konten, strikt getrennt"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:48 crates/app/src/about.rs:38
msgid "Drafts, and mail that is sent once you are online again"
msgstr "Entwürfe, und Mails werden gesendet, sobald du wieder online bist"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:51 crates/app/src/about.rs:41
msgid "External images only after you allow them"
msgstr "Externe Bilder erst nach deiner Freigabe"

#: data/io.github.deviablo.EMail.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid "First technical preview: connect one IMAP account and read your mail."
msgstr "Erste technische Vorschau: ein IMAP-Konto verbinden und Mails lesen."

